SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Doduo::
	.string "DODRIO: Gii giii!\p"
	.string "MIRROR, MIRROR ON THE WALL, WHO’S\n"
	.string "THE FAIREST ONE OF ALL?$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Pikachu::
	.string "This is a rare POKéMON!\n"
	.string "Huh?\p"
	.string "It’s only a doll...$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_1::
	.string "{PLAYER}: Hi! Do you like POKéMON?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: Uh, no, I just asked you.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: Huh?\n"
	.string "You’re strange!$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_2::
	.string "COPYCAT: Hmm?\n"
	.string "Quit mimicking?\p"
	.string "But that’s my favorite hobby!$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_3::
	.string "COPYCAT: Yay!\n"
	.string "That’s my CLEFAIRY POKéDOLL!\p"
	.string "See the tear where the right leg is\n"
	.string "sewn on? That’s proof!\p"
	.string "OK. Here’s the MAGNET TRAIN PASS\n"
	.string "like I promised!$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_4::
	.string "COPYCAT: That’s the PASS for the\n"
	.string "MAGNET TRAIN.\p"
	.string "The rail company man gave me that\n"
	.string "when they tore down our old house\l"
	.string "for the STATION.$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_5::
	.string "{PLAYER}: Hi!\n"
	.string "Thanks a lot for the rail PASS!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: Pardon?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: Is it that fun to mimic\n"
	.string "my every move?$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_6::
	.string "COPYCAT: You bet!\n"
	.string "It’s a scream!$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_7::
	.string "{PLAYER}: Hi!\n"
	.string "I heard that you lost your favorite\l"
	.string "POKéDOLL.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: If I find it, you’ll give me\n"
	.string "a rail PASS?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}: I’ll go find it for you.\p"
	.string "You think you lost it when you went\n"
	.string "to VERMILION CITY?$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Lass_8::
	.string "COPYCAT: Pardon?\p"
	.string "I shouldn’t decide what you should\n"
	.string "do?\p"
	.string "But I’m really worried... What if\n"
	.string "someone finds it?$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Sign1::
	.string "…\p"
	.string "My Secrets!\p"
	.string "Skill: Mimicry!\n"
	.string "Hobby: Collecting dolls!\l"
	.string "Favorite POKéMON: CLEFAIRY!$"

SaffronCity_Interior3_Text_Sign2::
	.string "A game with MARIO wearing a bucket\n"
	.string "on his head!$"
